# INVWINDS.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: a selection of
# the split view's contents dragged onto the tree with the driver's mouse
# lines.  A click and a SHIFT click choose items 1 and 3; a press on
# item 1 among them keeps both, and a drag from it ended by ESC keeps
# both through the release that follows; without a drag the release
# selects item 1 alone.  A drag of the two from item 3 onto Box B2,
# both framed as they go, moves them there as Move on several rows does:
# one note for both, the contents loaded again.  A drag from an item not
# chosen moves it alone; two dropped where one of them is note both; two
# of Box B2's own contents dropped on Box B2 move none and say nothing; an
# installed item among two dropped is refused, the box saying one of the
# two was moved.  An ESC typed with the release that drops two more, a P
# line's, which the list has taken as the rows begin, is dropped: both
# are moved and the contents keep the focus.  The end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINDS.SNP is its snapshot; TEST/selchk.py checks
# it.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER ALT-L B
S LOCS
M 221.1 DOWN ROW 0
M 221.1 UP ROW 0
M 221.1 SHIFT-DOWN ROW 1
M 221.1 UP ROW 1
S DSSEL
M 221.1 DOWN ROW 0
S DSHELD
M 221.1 MOVE ROW 0 8 0
S DSDRAG
K ESC
M 221.1 UP ROW 0
S DSESC
M 221.1 DOWN ROW 0
M 221.1 UP ROW 0
S DSCLICK
M 221.1 SHIFT-DOWN ROW 1
M 221.1 UP ROW 1
M 221.1 DOWN ROW 1
M 221.1 MOVE ROW 1 8 0
M 208.1 MOVE ROW 2
S DSOVER
M 208.1 UP ROW 2
S DSMOVED
# a drag from item 1, not among items 2 and 3 chosen, moves it alone
M 221.1 DOWN ROW 1
M 221.1 UP ROW 1
M 221.1 SHIFT-DOWN ROW 2
M 221.1 UP ROW 2
M 221.1 DOWN ROW 0
M 221.1 MOVE ROW 0 8 0
M 208.1 MOVE ROW 1
M 208.1 UP ROW 1
S DSONE
# items 1 and 2 onto Box B2, where item 2 is already
M 221.1 DOWN ROW 0
M 221.1 UP ROW 0
M 221.1 SHIFT-DOWN ROW 1
M 221.1 UP ROW 1
M 221.1 DOWN ROW 1
M 221.1 MOVE ROW 1 8 0
M 208.1 MOVE ROW 2
M 208.1 UP ROW 2
S DSTHERE
# Box B2's contents, items 1 to 3, items 1 and 2 dropped on Box B2
M 208.1 DOWN ROW 2
M 208.1 UP ROW 2
M 221.1 DOWN ROW 0
M 221.1 UP ROW 0
M 221.1 SHIFT-DOWN ROW 1
M 221.1 UP ROW 1
M 221.1 DOWN ROW 1
M 221.1 MOVE ROW 1 8 0
M 208.1 MOVE ROW 2
M 208.1 UP ROW 2
S DSSAME
M 208.1 DOWN ROW 0
M 208.1 UP ROW 0
# item 3 installed in item 1; items 2 and 3 onto Shelf A1: item 3 refused
M 221.1 DOWN ROW 2
M 221.1 UP ROW 2
K ALT-C I
T 1
K ENTER
M 221.1 DOWN ROW 1
M 221.1 UP ROW 1
M 221.1 SHIFT-DOWN ROW 2
M 221.1 UP ROW 2
M 221.1 DOWN ROW 1
M 221.1 MOVE ROW 1 8 0
M 208.1 MOVE ROW 1
M 208.1 UP ROW 1
S DSREF
K ENTER
S DSREFBK
# an ESC typed as items 2 and 1 are dropped on Office: both moved
M 221.1 DOWN ROW 0
M 221.1 UP ROW 0
M 221.1 SHIFT-DOWN ROW 1
M 221.1 UP ROW 1
M 221.1 DOWN ROW 1
M 221.1 MOVE ROW 1 8 0
M 208.1 MOVE ROW 0
M 208.1 UP ROW 0
P ESC
S DSTYPED
K ALT-F X
